## Global Search

```
GET /search?q=query
```

Searches across tracks, artists, and albums with a single query.

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `q` | string | Yes | Search query |

### Response

```json
{
  "tracks": [
    { "id": "uuid", "title": "...", "artist_id": "..." }
  ],
  "artists": [
    { "id": "uuid", "name": "..." }
  ],
  "albums": [
    { "id": "uuid", "title": "..." }
  ]
}
```

The response contains separate arrays for each entity type. The frontend parses and displays these in categorized sections.
